{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_06",
  "title": "若退路在燃燒",
  "storyCode": "EP-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dc01799f3d2d3879242e2b44a61db67deb3cb25ba24c2460fde784249968a6e5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "嘿，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "蒂奇？到底怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈維爾把審判庭的人引來了，胡安娜夫人被他們關在了船長室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你回來幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "不知道……大概和你的目的一樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等……對面甲板上躲著的……是你的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "那是伊西多嗎？想不到他竟然也回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "嘿，我就說嘛，連我都不放心了，更何況是他呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "我的朋友人這麼好，看到這邊的火光，當然會回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "text": "那我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "text": "為什麼我也要來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "呃，來救火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醒醒，夫人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "小珍珠……寶寶呢？你們不該回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我把寶寶送回鹽漠了，就算牠身體孱弱，也不是完全沒機會掙扎著活下去，至少比被叛亂的船員殺了還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們不能留您一個人在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "您的狀態看起來不太好……\n難道他們對您做了什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "沒有……他們只是讓我服用了一些藥劑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "你們本來可以逃走，可以活下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我以為你這樣固執的人不會放棄得那麼快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "既然我們都已經回來了，就別再說這些了。女士，你是船隊裡最熟悉鹽漠的人，你知道有什麼適合逃跑的好地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "我們現在有幾個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "二十四個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "很好，足以讓我們奪下一艘船離開這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪一艘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "征服宣告號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那艘老船……它的速度比不上新造的鹽船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "但我最熟悉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "況且，那艘船很舊，審判庭不會花費太多人力看守，我們奪船的難度不大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，我帶八個人去甲板，巡邏和放哨的我們會解決掉。剩下的人和極境先生從側舷摸進船艙，搞定其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "胡安娜夫人很虛弱，走得很慢……這一路，我希望你能照顧她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "放心，我會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "什麼動靜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我這把老骨頭啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可信的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "蒂奇，甲板上的傢伙全都打暈丟下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，快上桅杆，聽到我的指令就立刻升帆，我們需要以最快的速度開動船隻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "搞定了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "嗯，底下的人也都搞定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "女士，辛苦您幫個忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在就等夫人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "仔細搜查，執裁官閣下已經吩咐過了，一定要找到那個羅盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡責的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們已經翻遍每間屋子了，連相似的物品都沒找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再去找，或許有什麼地方遺漏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡責的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是，大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "二位，執裁官閣下的命令有變，立刻組織一支小隊和我追捕逃跑的煉金術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼是你來送信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們現在依照協議在合作，為什麼不可以是我來送信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盡責的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧，稍等片刻，我們去召集其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "辛苦二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "哈維爾為什麼會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我也不清楚，但無論如何，他都幫我們引開了那些習武教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "等他們離開，我們可以躲在那排帳篷後面繼續走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "不論從哪艘鹽船上都看不到那裡，他們不會發現的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "看得出來，你的逃跑經驗真的非常豐富。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "嘶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "再撐一下，很快就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "你先去甲板，我還要去工坊拿一些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "快去快回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是……舊時代的船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們對羅盤的渴求，難道指向災禍的源頭，那片海洋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我放在哪裡了呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "是你一直在指揮圍剿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是你一直在修復羅盤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "總有人勸我，說我應該把人想得更善良一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "事實總會證明他們的愚昧。最初見到你，我就知道你想將羅盤據為己有，為了你那罪惡的煉金研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我果然沒有看錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "羅盤已經毀了。我到現在都還沒能把它的殘骸從塑金台上摳下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那攤黑泥？不。那不是真正的羅盤，你的謊言毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "審判庭丟失的每一樣東西，都值得你們如此大費周章地大開殺戒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道羅盤能腐化人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我把它當作是航海道具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵，航海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "意圖反對世俗審判、逃避道德約束的人，總會走向那些人跡罕至的荊棘道路，駛向那些無人登陸的異域彼岸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "彷彿覺得不朽的事業，能成為他們一切罪名的庇護所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我不認為我有犯什麼罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "包庇偷竊犯、盜食鎮民遺體、襲擊審判庭教士，與為害城鎮的強盜為伍……這還不夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "欲加之罪而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵……你開始否認自己的罪行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "每一個犯下罪孽的人都會如此急切地否認，我也不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我最終承認了我的罪，我找到了贖罪的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的生命從最初就繫於食人的罪行，我的存在從最初就是罪孽的存在，我不配簡簡單單地死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你，你在被慾望沾染之前，曾是正直良善之人，你還有資格死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會幫助你獲得解脫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "真是瘋子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我沒有多餘的時間浪費在你身上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "奇怪，伊西多怎麼還沒回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒關係，反正他在這條船上，我們人就算是已經齊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大家都準備好了，只等你一聲令下，夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "升帆吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "我們該啟航了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這艘船……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "（該死……胡安娜不知道這個瘋子在這裡。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "（等船隻動起來，他只會帶來更多麻煩。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妄圖逃走的人，都在這裡了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們與這艘舊時代遺留下來的孽物，都會終止於此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "執裁官的攻勢越來越猛烈，伊西多只能勉強抵擋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "（這樣根本沒有用……總得做點什麼……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這是他的煉金工坊，總有他能在這裡做到的事情吧？\n在這裡他最擅長什麼呢？\n從在這裡生活的經歷來看，他做過最多的，無非是製造各式各樣的爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爆炸……\n是該有場爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "咳咳咳……呸！呸——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "……棘刺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "你終於來了，我在甲板上都快嚇死了，你說要去煉金工坊拿東西，結果等半天你都沒來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我在煉金工坊遇到了審判庭的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "底下的人我們都清理乾淨了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "我也不清楚，那個傢伙半路摸進來要找羅盤，一言不合就直接開始動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "為了甩掉他我只能引爆了煉金工坊，把他炸了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "你這個傢伙差點就把半艘船都炸掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "……做得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "不過，裡面的東西還在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "或許還能搶救一些出來……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "也好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "我們要去骸礁峽谷，穿過那裡就能進入海洋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "在那之前，你說不定還能再嘗試修復羅盤一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西爾弗閣下！執、執裁官閣下還在那艘船上！我們得去救他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那樣劇烈的爆炸，沒有人可以倖存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，執裁官閣下他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說了，不要去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "執裁官閣下壯烈犧牲，難道我們要浪費他為我們創造的生機，一廂情願地犧牲活人去拯救逝者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "萬一他還……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "此時此刻，雅隆才更需要你們。現在，去整理繳獲的物資，安置投降的海盜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "穩一點！桅杆要斷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "你是準備把船撞碎在骸骨上，讓我們掛在上面曬成鹹人乾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "左滿舵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——左滿舵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "text": "右舷受損了！如果再被蒸汽衝擊，船體會徹底解體的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "大型骨骸越來越密集了，掌握不好方向的話我們會先撞毀的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這裡已經開始有蒸汽噴發了，說明我們正在接近骸礁峽谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要躲進骸礁峽谷，那群混蛋就不敢追進來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "那我們自己怎麼辦？那裡遍地亂噴的高壓蒸汽隨便就能在船上射出一個洞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "總比被審判庭抓住還好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "……唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滾燙的蒸汽從骸骨的孔隙中噴出，驚人的力道撕開風帆。\n幾人在劇烈的衝擊下騰空而起，又重重摔回甲板。\n瘋狂旋轉的舵輪早已無法被握住，在蒸汽的衝擊下，船體不受控制地朝著一根十幾公尺高的龐大骸骨滑去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胡安娜沒有言語，像是在等待什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "……溫蒂！你是工程部的，有什麼方法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "text": "我也是第一次見到黃金時代的老船，更何況它還被改造成了這副模樣……我沒辦法現在就弄清楚它的運作原理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "那我們要棄船嗎？現在跳下去說不定還能活下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "你瘋了！沒有船的話，半分鐘之內你就會被鹽鱗直接貫穿的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——夫人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "完蛋了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胡安娜看向了瘋狂旋轉的舵輪。\n百年間，這艘船被拆去了所有皮肉，只留下一副骨架。原本華麗的錦帆被拆解，取而代之的是鱗皮縫製的粗糙風帆。\n但它的舵輪依然矗立在甲板的正中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是把手搭上了一位舞伴的腰，胡安娜扶住舵輪，狂放地轉動起來，墨色的長髮像狂潮中翻捲的水草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "久違了，老朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征服宣告號急劇傾斜，與龐大骸骨擦肩而過。船上的幾人拚命抓住繩索，才不至於被甩下船去。\n過去的幾十年，這艘古舊的船總因為過於沉重而不得不沿著其他鹽船留下的軌跡遲緩行動。\n但如今，它乘著風在龐大的骨骸間穿行，就像當年在胡安娜的掌控下，穿越險惡的礁石群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夫人……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "船穩住了，船穩住了……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "呼……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "我……活下來了？我沒死？我沒被掛在哪根骸骨上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "text": "……你之前只說讓我來救一下火……下次說清楚一點……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "這也算是一種救火，對吧……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "棘刺！怎麼樣？！這裡的東西還剩多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "站在滿地狼藉之中，幾人陷入了沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "塑金台算是勉強從工坊裡搶救出來了，雖然外殼毀了，但能量輸出還算穩定……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "探針……只剩下這支嚴重老化的了，幸好還能用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "之前從古董上拆出來的合金和源石也還有一點，不知道夠不夠用……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "有什麼我能幫你的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "如果你的手指和探針的針尖一樣細的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲悠長的咕嚕聲響起，極境有些尷尬地摀著自己的肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "text": "船上基本沒剩什麼食物了，照這樣下去，我可能很快就會瘦到你需要的程度……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "text": "……我們先找點東西吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
